  "id": "anticholinergic-drug",
  "term": "anticholinergic drug",
  "definition": "An anticholinergic drug is a medication that blocks acetylcholine receptors. In the eye, this can stop the iris sphincter and ciliary muscles from contracting, which enlarges the pupil and prevents accommodation.",
